2
00:00:03,510 --> 00:00:09,780
We need a broker and at least one publisher and one subscriber.
For the broker,
2

3
00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:11,120
there are many choices:
3

4
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:13,530
First, we could set up our own.
4

5
